      "writtenOn": "2025-08-07T15:00:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we actually need the memory barriers here? This should only be exercised by a guest, which is long after module loading and we should\u0027ve synchronised by then. Plus, you\u0027d need to handle UUID copy somehow if this was actually important.",
