      "writtenOn": "2025-08-22T12:28:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not following how `__ro_after_init` could be used here, but I think we still need the `cmpxchg64()` for atomicity. You can just use `cmpxchg64_relaxed()` instead of the release variant.",
