      "lineNbr": 1746,
      "author": {
        "id": 1898956
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-18T14:59:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wanted to sanitize the return values to make sure that the vendor implementation would adhere to the spec and limit potential abuse to implement other functionality using those HVCs. However I think I went too far with it. Done.",
      "parentUuid": "2d92e884_4663cb20",
      "range": {
