      },
      "lineNbr": 1756,
      "author": {
        "id": 1572468
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-07T15:00:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why do we care about endianness here?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1749,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1756,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "0a1b3d57002db824f9a57df6711882975c91987f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "66afc5d4_3b2170c3",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/kvm/hyp/nvhe/pkvm.c",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 1756,
      "author": {
        "id": 1898956
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-18T14:59:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The module would fill the entropy buffer in little endian. On the odd change of ARM64 big endian device running this code, it would fail.",
      "parentUuid": "31e69875_ec65ddfc",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1749,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1756,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "0a1b3d57002db824f9a57df6711882975c91987f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2ac3d942_48dbba0b",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/kvm/hyp/nvhe/pkvm.c",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 1756,
      "author": {
        "id": 1572468
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-22T12:28:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m just having a hard time understanding how the endianness matters for entropy. What goes wrong if you don\u0027t byte swap it?",
      "parentUuid": "66afc5d4_3b2170c3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1749,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1756,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "0a1b3d57002db824f9a57df6711882975c91987f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d346b9ca_a68eb0f5",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/kvm/hyp/nvhe/pkvm.c",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 1756,
      "author": {
        "id": 1898956
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-22T13:31:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It does not matter for the entropy, but how entropy bits are delivered to the client. If the endianness would be not considered here, the client would expect the entropy bits at the wrong end of the registers.",
      "parentUuid": "2ac3d942_48dbba0b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1749,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1756,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "0a1b3d57002db824f9a57df6711882975c91987f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
